{"3947270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Road Survival: Bigger on the Inside", "steam_appid": 3947270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROAD SURVIVAL: Bigger on the Inside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse has turned every highway into a journey into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your RV north and scavenge abandoned towns, stores, laboratories, and roadside ruins for food, fuel, equipment, furniture, and anything else worth bringing home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the farther you travel, the more dangerous the world becomes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadlier weather, stronger infected, and dwindling resources force you to keep improving the one thing that stays with you throughout the journey — your RV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce its body and windows, install new equipment, upgrade its power and survival systems, and recover lost <strong>Folded Space technology</strong> to expand the interior far beyond its physical size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a cramped shelter can gradually become a fully equipped mobile base with storage, kitchens, farms, livestock areas, workshops, and comfortable living spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world outside grows more hostile.</strong><br><br><strong>Your home grows safer, stronger, and warmer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the road is never just about loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded survivors, strange traders, abandoned vehicles, temporary camps, and unexpected encounters may be waiting around the next turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You never know what waits down the road.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge. Hoard. Upgrade. Fortify. Expand. Farm. Cook. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then close the door, take your home with you, and keep moving north.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/3a99ce2f33cb045ee6cfaedbd07fa4cc.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/3a99ce2f33cb045ee6cfaedbd07fa4cc.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP MOVING NORTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your RV through the post-apocalyptic wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for supplies, explore abandoned locations, discover new places, and decide where to make your next stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No one knows what waits at the end of the road.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/440a467bfab994b518fa663658043f33.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/440a467bfab994b518fa663658043f33.mp4?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU NEVER KNOW WHAT WAITS AHEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stranded survivor may need your help. A trader may offer an unexpected deal. An abandoned vehicle on the roadside may hide something valuable — or something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters bring opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others bring trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every stop can become a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/b0a9a345b682bdb3fed2d2c3341d473d.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/b0a9a345b682bdb3fed2d2c3341d473d.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCAVENGE IT. HAUL IT HOME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search abandoned stores, houses, laboratories, and facilities for anything that can still be useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food. Tools. Equipment. Containers. Furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you can use it, find a way to bring it home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you haul back today may become part of your next upgrade tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/cbdafcfb3dddb5c48b4b2488ead3833f.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/cbdafcfb3dddb5c48b4b2488ead3833f.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE &amp; FORTIFY YOUR RV</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your RV is more than transportation — it is the heart of your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install new equipment, improve power, storage, and survival systems, and reinforce the vehicle against infected and increasingly hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The farther you travel, the stronger your RV becomes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/1604e24b78f5810d5daed42f883cb341.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/1604e24b78f5810d5daed42f883cb341.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/5f04666cff319226e694d894f7e91dac.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/5f04666cff319226e694d894f7e91dac.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BIGGER ON THE INSIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned research facilities and recover lost Folded Space technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the physical limits of your RV and expand its once-cramped interior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the outside, it is still just an RV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inside, it can hold an entire home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/3ba6b6cf8ed447df698424af8b500128.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/3ba6b6cf8ed447df698424af8b500128.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A MOBILE BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage rooms. Kitchens. Workshops. Farms. Livestock areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your RV grows, more and more of your life can travel with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never have to leave your base behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your base travels with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/a87a3908b4e893e283af48b98a80723b.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/a87a3908b4e893e283af48b98a80723b.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A LIFE ON THE ROAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, prepare ingredients, cook meals, raise animals, organize your supplies, and slowly improve the way you live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying alive is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a life worth surviving for.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD GETS WORSE. YOUR HOME GETS BETTER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain pounds against the windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected wander outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile weather sweeps across the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after every upgrade, every reinforcement, and every expansion, your RV becomes safer and more comfortable than it was before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close the reinforced door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw the curtains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook something warm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outside is the apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inside is the home you built.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROAD SURVIVAL: Bigger on the Inside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse has turned every highway into a journey into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your RV north and scavenge abandoned towns, stores, laboratories, and roadside ruins for food, fuel, equipment, furniture, and anything else worth bringing home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the farther you travel, the more dangerous the world becomes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadlier weather, stronger infected, and dwindling resources force you to keep improving the one thing that stays with you throughout the journey — your RV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce its body and windows, install new equipment, upgrade its power and survival systems, and recover lost <strong>Folded Space technology</strong> to expand the interior far beyond its physical size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a cramped shelter can gradually become a fully equipped mobile base with storage, kitchens, farms, livestock areas, workshops, and comfortable living spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world outside grows more hostile.</strong><br><br><strong>Your home grows safer, stronger, and warmer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the road is never just about loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded survivors, strange traders, abandoned vehicles, temporary camps, and unexpected encounters may be waiting around the next turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You never know what waits down the road.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge. Hoard. Upgrade. Fortify. Expand. Farm. Cook. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then close the door, take your home with you, and keep moving north.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/3a99ce2f33cb045ee6cfaedbd07fa4cc.poster.avif?t=1788184991\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/3a99ce2f33cb045ee6cfaedbd07fa4cc.webm?t=1788184991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP MOVING NORTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dri